OL,3,GNEWSAO'Neill clashes with committee
OL,4,Amembers over Garvaghy Road
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe First Minister Michelle O'Neill has
OL,7,Fclashed with unionist politicians at a
OL,8,FStormont committee over her involvement
OL,9,Fin protests on the Garvaghy Road
OL,10,Fblocking an Orange Order parade last
OL,11,Fmonth.
OL,13,FUnionist parties have called for action
OL,14,Fagainst O'Neill and others over the
OL,15,Fprotests, accusing nationalist parties
OL,16,Fof acting unlawfully.
OL,18,FShe and other senior Sinn Fein
OL,19,Frepresentatives have received letters
OL,20,Ffrom the police who are investigating
OL,21,Fthe matter.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
